{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00694",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.34,
      "end_seconds": 12.64,
      "duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "text": "Hello. I'm here for the results of my cholesterol thing, I think. Or is it a new thing? I've forgotten what I booked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.7,
      "end_seconds": 23.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.53,
      "text": "It's the follow-up for the cholesterol, yes. Three months ago we started a statin. How have you got on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.23,
      "end_seconds": 33.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Oh, the tablets, yes. The little white one at bedtime. Atorvastatin, 40 mg, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.33,
      "end_seconds": 40.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "And how are you feeling in yourself on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.46,
      "end_seconds": 53.01,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "Well, my legs ache. Both thighs, mostly, since about the second week. Like I've run a marathon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.97,
      "end_seconds": 62.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Is the ache constant or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.94,
      "end_seconds": 75.86,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "It's there most days, worse on the stairs. And I'm tired, tired all the time, I've been dragging."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.47,
      "end_seconds": 81.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Any headaches or stomach trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.31,
      "end_seconds": 90.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "A few headaches, yes, in the afternoon. Nothing terrible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.57,
      "end_seconds": 99.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Any dark urine, or muscle weakness, difficulty getting out of a chair?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.1,
      "end_seconds": 105.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "No, nothing like that. The urine's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.56,
      "end_seconds": 110.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Do you take anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.28,
      "end_seconds": 117.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Aspirin, 75 mg, once a day. I thought I'd mentioned."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.01,
      "end_seconds": 122.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Thanks. Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.71,
      "end_seconds": 127.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Codeine. It makes me throw up, terribly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.21,
      "end_seconds": 135.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Noted. And what's your health history, besides the cholesterol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.08,
      "end_seconds": 145.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "High cholesterol, that's why I'm here. And I had my gallbladder out, years ago. About 2012."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.25,
      "end_seconds": 153.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "Let me check your pulse and temperature, and then examine your muscles. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.11,
      "end_seconds": 157.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.38,
      "end_seconds": 171.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Pulse 70, temperature 36.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.01,
      "end_seconds": 176.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Normal, I hope. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.39,
      "end_seconds": 197.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Normal. Now press against my hands with your legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.44,
      "end_seconds": 202.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Like this? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.52,
      "end_seconds": 210.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Good strength. Your thigh muscles aren't tender when I press them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.44,
      "end_seconds": 215.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "So it's not serious? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.14,
      "end_seconds": 233.39,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "Your strength is normal, and that's reassuring. The aches and tiredness could be a statin side effect, so I'd say statin-related muscle aches are likely."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.8,
      "end_seconds": 237.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "What do I do? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.68,
      "end_seconds": 254.58,
      "duration_seconds": 13.9,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a blood test for muscle enzymes, called CK, and check your thyroid, because an underactive thyroid can mimic this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.78,
      "end_seconds": 260.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Do I stop the tablets? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.04,
      "end_seconds": 274.73,
      "duration_seconds": 12.69,
      "text": "Not yet, wait for the results, but if the aches become severe or your urine goes dark, stop and ring us at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.52,
      "end_seconds": 281.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Right. How will I know the results? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.97,
      "end_seconds": 290.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in a week, when they're back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.31,
      "end_seconds": 303.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.94,
      "text": "A week. Put it in my diary. Where's my diary? Never mind, you'll remind me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.7,
      "end_seconds": 308.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "The reception will text you. ~"
    }
  ]
}
